## 文献检索记录

### PubMed 搜索查询

1. `dorsal striatum habit formation goal-directed behavior outcome devaluation` → 相关文献，找到 Yin/Balleine 经典系列
2. `Yin Knowlton Balleine dorsolateral dorsomedial striatum` → 确认 PMID:14750976 (DLS) 和 PMID:16045504 (DMS)
3. `Balleine O'Doherty human goal-directed habit reward learning` → 确认 PMID:19776734 (PMC3055420 开放全文)
4. `model-based model-free reinforcement learning striatum prefrontal cortex` → 确认 Daw et al. 2011 PMID:21435563
5. `infralimbic cortex habit prelimbic goal-directed behavior rats` → 确认 Coutureau & Killcross 2003 PMID:14643469
6. `Daw model-based model-free Neuron 2011 humans fMRI` → 确认 PMC3077926 开放全文
7. `habit formation review striatum dopamine instrumental conditioning` → 确认 Faure et al. 2005 PMC6725127
8. `dorsal striatum neuronal encoding instrumental learning review 2024 2025` → 找到 Varin 2025 PMID:39632222, Hart 2024 PMID:38521480

### 全文获取

- PMC3055420 (Balleine & O'Doherty 2010)：成功获取，用作主要综述基础
- PMC6725127 (Faure et al. 2005)：成功获取，DA 耗竭实验全文
- PMC3077926 (Daw et al. 2011)：成功获取，两步任务 fMRI 全文
- PMC8653515 (Green & Bouton 2021)：成功获取，PL/IL 修订模型
- PMC6345614 (Shipman et al. 2018)：成功获取，PL vs IL 训练历史效应

### 总来源数

- 全文可用：6/10
- 仅摘要：4/10 (PMID:14750976, PMID:16045504, PMID:14643469, PMID:38521480, PMID:39632222)

